<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(What you\220ll be learning This course provides a comprehensive introduction to data analytics and visualization using Microsoft Excel. Designed for beginners and those with some Excel experience, the course covers both foundational and advanced Excel techniques through hands-on practice and real-world examples. By the end of the course, students will be able to clean, analyze, and visualize data with confidence. Emphasis is placed on mastering Excel\220s powerful features, including PivotTables, advanced formulas, and automation tools, to derive actionable insights in modern business contexts.)/E(What you\220ll be learning This course provides a comprehensive introduction to data analytics and visualization using Microsoft Excel. Designed for beginners and those with some Excel experience, the course covers both foundational and advanced Excel techniques through hands-on practice and real-world examples. By the end of the course, students will be able to clean, analyze, and visualize data with confidence. Emphasis is placed on mastering Excel\220s powerful features, including PivotTables, advanced formulas, and automation tools, to derive actionable insights in modern business contexts.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[36]>>
